  "slug": "general-contractor-safety-walk-checklist-form",
  "title": "General Contractor Safety Walk and Corrective Action Register",
  "subtitle": "Plan the inspection, screen active hazards, document immediate controls, assign correction, escalate stop-work conditions, and verify accountable closeout.",
  "description": "A workflow-complete construction safety walk covering inspection authority, site and shift conditions, high-risk work and permit review, systematic observations, hazard classification, immediate controls, stop-work escalation, corrective-action ownership, reinspection evidence, crew communication, and unresolved-item handoff.",
  "use_case": "Use when a superintendent, safety lead, competent person, or project manager needs one fillable record that connects a field safety walk to prompt hazard control and documented verification without losing open exceptions.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
